<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 36, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>下阶段时间节点</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B9CCEA' }}>04 · Plan</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 598, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 42 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        四个阶段自 2027 年 1 月起算，节点与《中期检查表》所列计划一致；2026 年 12 月至 2027 年 6 月为问题 01、03 的对策落地期。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 400, marginTop: 16 }}>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 20px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>2026.12 — 2027.06</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 14 }}>问题对策落地</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.85 }}>
          · 跨帧掩码传播<br />· 密集人群场景重评测<br />· 多楼层采集（≥3 层 / ≥2000 m²）<br />· 第二篇论文整理
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>交付：掩码召回 ≥ 0.85</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 20px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>2027.07 — 2027.12</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 14 }}>语义高斯场</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.85 }}>
          · 码本压缩至 64 维<br />· 增量更新避免全量重算<br />· 开放词汇查询评测集<br />· 边缘平台驻留测试
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>交付：查询召回 ≥ 0.80</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 20px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>2028.01 — 2028.03</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 14 }}>联合导航与实机</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.85 }}>
          · 语义—几何联合导航闭环<br />· 四足平台实机验证<br />· 导航失败案例回收<br />· 分层地图跨楼层验证
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>交付：实机闭环成功率报告</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 20px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #8B97A8', background: '#F7F9FC' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>2028.03 — 2028.05</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 14 }}>论文与答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.85 }}>
          · 学位论文撰写<br />· 预送审与修改<br />· 正式送审<br />· 答辩准备
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>交付：学位论文与答辩</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 20, padding: '12px 24px', background: '#E8EFF8', height: 76 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>风险缓冲　</span>若 2027 年上半年掩码改进未达预期，将把研究内容 2 的码本压缩与内容 3 的实机验证串行化，优先保证学位论文主体完整，导航部分收缩为单楼层闭环。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 50, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态环境下视觉语言模型辅助三维高斯语义建图与机器人目标导航</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>24 / 26</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
